sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User (web app)
    participant API as Lambda API
    participant DB as Supabase (PostgreSQL)
    User->>API: POST /api/teams/:id/invitation<br/>accept: true
    API->>DB: Read approved team, invitation and player account
    DB-->>API: Valid invitation and eligible player
    API->>DB: Save acceptance, roster membership and transfer atomically
    DB-->>API: Team and account updates committed
    API-->>User: Updated team including the new member
